OL,3,GNEWSABy-election set after Reform UK
OL,4,Acouncillor quits
OL,5,
OL,6,FA date has been set for a by-election
OL,7,Fafter a Reform UK councillor quit her
OL,8,Fseat on Leicestershire County Council.
OL,10,FHelen Butler, who was division
OL,11,Fcouncillor for Shepshed, stepped down
OL,12,Fin August, saying she wanted to spend
OL,13,Fmore time with her family.
OL,15,FShe was part of the minority Reform UK
OL,16,Fadministration that took control of
OL,17,FCounty Hall after the elections in May
OL,18,F2025.
OL,20,FVoters in Shepshed will have the chance
OL,21,Fto elect a new councillor on 15
OL,22,FOctober.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
